          0,
          4725,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Same weights, same Mac. Written the obvious way, the loop spends 940.3 ms on every token. With the whole\nengine around it, and two agents sharing it, each token takes 31.0 ms.",
      "originalText": "Same weights, same Mac. Written the obvious way, the loop spends 940.3 ms on every token. With the whole\nengine around it, and two agents sharing it, each token takes 31.0 ms.",
