        ]
      },
      "text": "Every step is weighed the same way: the bytes it must move and the FLOPs it must do, against what this Mac\nmeasures for each. Decode does half a FLOP per byte, far under the ridge, so memory sets its time.",
      "originalText": "Every step is weighed the same way: the bytes it must move and the FLOPs it must do, against what this Mac\nmeasures for each. Decode does half a FLOP per byte, far under the ridge, so memory sets its time.",
